1 Overview
**********

Hellmacs is designed for developers who write enterprise software on the
JVM (Spring Boot, Maven, Gradle, multi-module enterprise codebases) and
want a rock-solid, ultra-fast environment that respects GNU Emacs
traditions.

   Key objectives:
  1. *Daily JVM Parity*: Deep code completion, refactoring, navigation,
     diagnostics, test runners, debugging, and Spring Boot integration.
  2. *Strict Startup Budget*: Starts in under 0.12 seconds with 60+
     packages byte-compiled ahead of time.
  3. *Enterprise Ready*: Full support for corporate proxies, custom CA
     truststores, internal artifact mirrors (Artifactory, Nexus), and
     100% offline bundles.
  4. *Zero Modal Hijacking*: Stock Emacs keybindings are preserved
     completely.  No modal editing, no Evil mode, no ‘SPC’ leader
     hijacks.


