3 Installation and Profiles
***************************

Hellmacs is installed via the ‘bin/hellmacs-install’ script:
     git clone https://github.com/petrolal/hellmacs.git ~/.config/emacs
     bin/hellmacs install

3.1 Profiles
============

Hellmacs supports isolated profiles:
   • *default*: The primary configuration located at
     ‘~/.config/hellmacs/’.
   • *dev*: Isolated development testing profile in ‘profiles/dev/’.
   • *safe-mode*: Clean baseline profile with only built-in packages.

   Run commands on specific profiles using ‘-p NAME’:
     bin/hellmacs -p dev sync
     bin/hellmacs -p dev doctor


