5 IntelliJ Parity & Key Finder
******************************

For developers migrating from JetBrains IntelliJ IDEA, Hellmacs includes
the interactive IntelliJ Key Finder:
     M-x hellmacs-where-is-intellij
   Shortcut: ‘C-c h k’ or ‘C-c h ?’.

   Type any IntelliJ shortcut (e.g.  ‘Shift-F6’, ‘Ctrl-Alt-L’, ‘Double
Shift’, ‘Ctrl-N’) to immediately see the equivalent GNU Emacs keychord
and execute the command.


