6 Enhanced Dired & Projectile
*****************************

6.1 Enhanced Dired (‘:emacs dired’)
===================================

File management in Hellmacs is enhanced with:
   • Colored filetype glyphs via ‘nerd-icons-dired’.
   • Batch file renaming as editable text: press ‘r’ or ‘C-x C-q’ in
     Dired to enter ‘wdired-mode’.
   • Quick sorting menu: press ‘S’ in Dired to sort by name, size, date,
     or extension.
   • Automatic reuse of Dired buffers to keep buffer lists clean.

6.2 Projectile (‘:tools projectile’)
====================================

Fast project exploration and buffer management:
   • ‘C-c p f’: Find file in project with fuzzy search.
   • ‘C-c p s r’: Ripgrep search across project.
   • ‘C-c p b’: Switch between project-specific buffers.


