9 Enterprise & Team Layer
*************************

Hellmacs is built for corporate network requirements.

9.1 Team Layer
==============

Share configuration across your engineering team with
‘$HELLMACS_TEAM_DIR’:
     export HELLMACS_TEAM_DIR="/path/to/shared/company-hellmacs-layer"
   Or install directly from git:
     bin/hellmacs install --team https://git.internal.corp/team-hellmacs.git

9.2 Proxies and Custom CAs
==========================

In ‘init.el’:
     (setq hellmacs-net-proxy "http://proxy.corp.internal:8080"
           hellmacs-net-ca-file "/etc/pki/ca-trust/source/anchors/corp-root.crt")

9.3 Offline Bundles
===================

Install on air-gapped systems with zero internet access:
     bin/hellmacs install --from-bundle /path/to/hellmacs-bundle.tar.gz


